      en: ["Located on the western shore of Guanabara Bay.", "Total quay length spans approximately 6,700 meters.", "Home to Pier Mauá, Brazil's leading terminal for international cruise ships.", "Major hub for handling iron and steel products in the Southeast region.", "Directly connected to the BR-101, BR-040, and BR-116 highways.", "Underwent massive revitalization via the 'Porto Maravilha' urban project."],
